      "decision": "keep",
      "reason": "比较数据有效但 HTML 或索引缺失时仍失败，防止把不完整交付报告说成验证通过。"
    },
    {
      "test": "test_compound_result_preserves_both_limitations_and_report_failure",
      "decision": "keep",
      "reason": "比较成功而报告失败时总结果必须失败并保留两边限制，不能只采纳成功子结果。"
    },
    {
      "test": "test_conflicting_types_rejected_even_when_one_marker_is_malformed",
